# to-spec

Apply the to-spec skill when the request matches its scope.

Capabilities:
- produce to spec artifact
- validate to spec completion criteria
- trace to spec decisions across inputs, constraints, and failure paths
- validate project outcomes with evidence, assumptions, and explicit next steps

Stop when: Turn the current conversation into a spec and publish it to the project issue tracker - no interview, just synthesis of what is already known complete; structured result returned; completion criteria checked.
